CLAUDE.local.md

# Written by /plugin install, and deliberately not shared: which plugins are enabled is a
# per-developer choice in this repo. Not added to the template's gitignore list — by Claude
# Code's own convention settings.json is the shared file and settings.local.json the personal
# one, so ignoring it is a local decision here, not a pattern for adopters.
.claude/settings.json

# Serena MCP server's per-project config, cache and memories. Whether a developer runs Serena
# is a personal choice, like .claude/settings.json above; it regenerates the directory on
# activation, so nothing is lost by not sharing it. Local decision, not a pattern for adopters.
.serena/
